{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42951","headline":"芳树 · 符子珪","name":"芳树","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芳树宜三月，曈曈艳绮年。\n香交珠箔气，阴占绿庭烟。\n小叶风吹长，繁花露濯鲜。\n遂令穠李儿，折取簪花钿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"符子珪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42951.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42951","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}